OL,3,GNEWSAEconomy minister accuses SoS of
OL,4,A'mischief making' in social media
OL,5,Aexchange
OL,6,
OL,7,FEconomy Minister Dr Caoimhe Archibald
OL,8,Fhas questioned whether the secretary of
OL,9,Fstate is "mischief making" after a
OL,10,Fsocial media exchange around energy
OL,11,Fpayments.
OL,13,FThe Sinn Fein MLA posted on X about a
OL,14,Fnew one-off electricity bill reduction
OL,15,Fannounced on Thursday, which Sir Chris
OL,16,FBryant, reposted saying: "I'm really
OL,17,Fglad that the UK government is funding
OL,18,Fthis."
OL,20,FArchibald said she was "bemused and
OL,21,Fsurprised" at his "intervention on
OL,22,Fsocial media".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
