OL,5,Aexchange
OL,6,
OL,7,FA UK government spokesperson said the
OL,8,Ffunding for the Household Electricity
OL,9,FDiscount Scheme was provided through
OL,10,Fthe prime minister's "commitment to
OL,11,Fremove VAT and some levies from
OL,12,Felectricity bills".
